{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "730d46a1-dc04-8fe6-b543-80075375fe5b",
  "created_at": "2025-12-29T10:22:29-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Celeste Tavares",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:18:15-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:18:20-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Denise. Yeah, hi. Sorry, I'm a little foggy, I just woke up from a wicked long nap. Anyway, I'm calling about the catch basin in front of my house. It's full of sand, and the street's been holding water since before the holidays."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:18:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, no problem. Whereabouts are you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:18:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "138 Malbone Road, in the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:18:47-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "138 Malbone. And when you say it's holding water, is that right at the drain?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:18:54-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, right at the drain, and it spreads out into the road. It's not even raining. It's been dry, and there's still this big puddle sitting there. Then it freezes at night. The sand is from the winter road treatment, I guess. It's packed in the basin like cement. The water has nowhere to go."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:19:17-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That makes sense. They put a lot of sand down this time of year and it washes right into the basins."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:19:27-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. And here's the thing, I called about this already. Somebody told me it was a state road, so it wasn't the city's problem. That was a while back. But I'm looking at it and it's our street, Denise. It's a wicked mess."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:19:45-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Let me pull up the street. [pause] Okay, I'm looking at the map. Malbone Road, part of it can be state-maintained, and that depends on the stretch. Do you know the nearest cross street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:20:01-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's, um, down toward the Middletown line side, a few houses up from the corner store. I don't know the cross street offhand. I'd have to go look."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:20:13-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all right. I can still note it by your house number. Is the basin on your side of the street or across?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:20:23-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "My side. Right at the end of my driveway, almost. Honestly I'm tired of getting told it's somebody else's. Every time, it's somebody else's."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:20:34-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understandable. Here's what I'll do. I'll open a work order for the catch basin at 138 Malbone for cleaning, sand buildup and standing water. If it turns out that stretch belongs to the state, our office will pass it to them directly, so you don't have to start over."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:20:55-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So, will there be a date? Like when's somebody coming? Because if I call back in a week and nobody's been here, I'm gonna be, you know, not happy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:21:08-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair question. Basin cleaning is usually scheduled in a batch, so I'd tell you it's a matter of a week or two, and standing water that freezes gets bumped up. I'll mark it as a hazard for icing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:21:24-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A week or two. Okay. That's, well, it's been sitting since before Christmas already."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:21:31-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I know. I'll put that in the notes, that it's been ongoing since before the holidays so nobody thinks it's new. Can I confirm a number to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:21:44-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0182."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:21:46-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 0182. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:21:49-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Celeste Tavares. T-A-V-A-R-E-S."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:21:51-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Celeste. You'll get a call back from us either way, whether it's scheduled or we've handed it to the state. If you see it clear up before then, let us know so we can close it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:22:07-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll believe it when I see the truck, but thank you. I appreciate you actually writing it down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:22:16-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course. Go get some coffee, and have a good rest of your Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:22:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha, yeah, I need it. Bye, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:22:27-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye now."
    }
  ],
